  "question": {
    "text": "A bag contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> red and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;black balls. A ball is drawn at random from the bag, its color is observed and this ball along with two additional balls of the same color are returned to the bag. If now a ball is drawn at random from the bag, then the probability that this drawn ball is red, is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0175_414d726842e3.png\" style=\"width: 163px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0175_ba169e1ac305.png\" style=\"width: 327px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0175_b41b5c05df3c.png\" style=\"width: 444px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0175_fd56af69df5f.png\" style=\"width: 460px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;Ball drawn from bag is observed to be Red after&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;has occurred.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0175_003527d0eb42.png\" style=\"width: 205px; height: 180px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>48</mn><mn>120</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
